  "description": "Field Dependencies helps Dynamics 365 and Dataverse developers identify where fields are referenced across CRM configuration, JavaScript, plugins, custom workflow activities, and other supported components. It provides code-level evidence, entity-aware reference verification, usage classification, and analysis coverage information. The tool aims to help developers understand field usage before modifying or removing fields.",
